                  },
                  "type": "tile"
                },
                {
                  "content": "{%- from 'flight_watcher.jinja' import pot_table -%}\n{%- set mo = now().year * 12 + now().month - 1 + (states('input_number.flight_watcher_james_month_offset') | int(0)) -%}\n{%- set key = '%04d-%02d' | format(mo // 12, mo % 12 + 1) -%}\n{%- set sch = (state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_schedule', 'months') or {}).get(key) -%}\n{%- set ps = (state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_pot_count', 'pairings') or []) + (state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_tradeboard_pickups', 'pairings') or []) -%}\n{%- set st = states('sensor.flight_watcher_james_state') -%}\n{%- set lc = states('sensor.flight_watcher_james_last_check') -%}\n{%- set t = as_datetime(lc) if lc not in ['unknown', 'unavailable'] else none -%}\n{%- set fresh = st in ['idle', 'hunting'] and t is not none and (now() - t).total_seconds() < 900 -%}\n{%- if not fresh and t -%}\n<ha-alert alert-type=\"warning\">Pot last read {{ (t | as_local).strftime('%b %-d %H:%M') }}. May be out of date until the Watcher is running again.</ha-alert>\n\n{% endif -%}\n{{ pot_table(ps, sch['items'] if sch else none, key, is_state('input_boolean.flight_watcher_james_show_vac_trips', 'on'), state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_blocked_days', 'days') or []) }}\n\n<details><summary><b>Key</b></summary>\n\n- **T** after a trip = Tradeboard pickup post; the rest are the open time pot\n- **Soft**: soft time\n- **CA**: captain\n- **Fits**: no overlap with your trips or VAC\n- **FAR**: 10 h rest before and after, 30 h off in 168 h, 100 h flying in 672 h\n- **CBA rest**: legal, but under the 11 h company minimum\n- **?**: not read yet\n- Trips on VAC or blocked days are hidden: tap **Show VAC/blocked**\n- Block a day: tap it on the schedule calendar\n\n</details>",
                  "entity_id": [
                    "input_number.flight_watcher_james_month_offset",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_schedule",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_pot_count",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_state",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_last_check",
                    "input_boolean.flight_watcher_james_show_vac_trips",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_blocked_days",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_tradeboard_pickups"
                  ],
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": "full"
                  },
                  "type": "markdown"
                },
                {
                  "badges": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.flight_watcher_james_would_trade",
                      "name": "Marked",
                      "show_name": true,
                      "show_state": true,
                      "type": "entity"
                    }
                  ],
                  "heading": "Swap ideas",
                  "heading_style": "subtitle",
                  "icon": "mdi:swap-horizontal-bold",
                  "type": "heading"
                },
                {
                  "content": "{%- set ideas = state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_swap_ideas', 'ideas') or [] -%}\n{%- set marked = state_attr('sensor.flight_watcher_james_would_trade', 'keys') or [] -%}\n{%- if marked | count == 0 -%}\nNo trips marked. Tap a trip number on the calendar to mark one you'd trade for something better.\n{%- elif ideas | count == 0 -%}\nWatching for better trips than: **{{ marked | map('regex_replace', '\\\\|.*', '') | join(', ') }}**. Nothing better right now.\n{%- else -%}\n| Give up | For | Dates | Layover | Days | Credit | Soft | Gain | Src | Grid |\n|:--|:--|:--|:--|--:|--:|--:|:--|:-:|:--|\n{%- for i in ideas %}\n| {{ i.for_trip }} | **{{ i.pairing }}** | {{ i.dates }} | {{ i.layover if i.layover not in [none, '', '-none-'] else ('**' ~ i.turn ~ '**' if i.turn else 'turn') }} | {{ i.days }} | {{ i.credit }} | {{ i.soft }} | **{{ i.soft_gain }}** soft, {{ i.credit_gain }} cr | {{ i.src }} | {{ '**OK**' if i.grid_ok | default(false) else (i.grid | default('?')) }} |\n{%- endfor %}\n{%- endif %}\n\n<details><summary><b>Key</b></summary>\n\n- Better = soft time up 0:30+, or credit up 1:00+ without losing soft time\n- Must be legal with your trip gone: FAR OK, 11 h home rest, no VAC or blocked day\n- **Grid**: the new trip must share a day with yours, and every day you move off must be green on the reserve grid; red ideas wait and push when the grid turns green\n\n</details>",
                  "entity_id": [
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_swap_ideas",
                    "sensor.flight_watcher_james_would_trade"
