        {
          "icon": "mdi:airplane",
          "max_columns": 2,
          "path": "wx",
          "sections": [
            {
              "cards": [
                {
                  "badges": [
                    {
                      "entity": "sensor.wx_station_icao",
                      "name": "ICAO",
                      "show_name": true,
                      "show_state": true,
                      "type": "entity"
                    }
                  ],
                  "heading": "Aviation weather",
                  "icon": "mdi:weather-windy",
                  "type": "heading"
                },
                {
                  "entities": [
                    {
                      "entity": "input_text.wx_station",
                      "name": "Airport (ICAO or IATA, e.g. PHMU, KOA, LAX, NRT)"
                    }
                  ],
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": "full"
                  },
                  "type": "entities"
                },
                {
                  "content": "{%- set icao = states('sensor.wx_station_icao') -%}\n{%- macro age(e) -%}{%- set t = states(e) -%}{%- if t not in ['none', 'unknown', 'unavailable', ''] -%}{{ ((now() - as_datetime(t)).total_seconds() / 60) | int }} min ago{%- else -%}no report{%- endif -%}{%- endmacro -%}\n{%- set mid = state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'icaoId') -%}\n## {{ icao }}{{ ' ' ~ state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'name') if mid == icao and state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'name') else '' }}{{ ' <sub>' ~ state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'fltCat') ~ '</sub>' if mid == icao and state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'fltCat') else '' }}\n### METAR <sub>{{ age('sensor.wx_metar_station') if mid == icao else '' }}</sub>\n```\n{{ state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'rawOb') if mid == icao and state_attr('sensor.wx_metar_station', 'rawOb') else 'No METAR for ' ~ icao ~ ' on the network right now' }}\n```\n### TAF <sub>{{ ('issued ' ~ age('sensor.wx_taf_station')) if state_attr('sensor.wx_taf_station', 'icaoId') == icao else '' }}</sub>\n```\n{{ (state_attr('sensor.wx_taf_station', 'rawTAF') | regex_replace(' (FM|TEMPO|BECMG|PROB)', '\\n  \\\\1')) if state_attr('sensor.wx_taf_station', 'icaoId') == icao and state_attr('sensor.wx_taf_station', 'rawTAF') else 'No TAF for ' ~ icao ~ (' (AWOS field; PHKO is the nearest TAF, below)' if icao == 'PHMU' else '') }}\n```\n### D-ATIS {{ states('sensor.wx_atis_station') if state_attr('sensor.wx_atis_station', 'airport') == icao else '' }}\n```\n{{ state_attr('sensor.wx_atis_station', 'datis') if state_attr('sensor.wx_atis_station', 'airport') == icao and state_attr('sensor.wx_atis_station', 'datis') else 'No D-ATIS for ' ~ icao ~ (' (AWOS-3 field)' if icao == 'PHMU' else '') }}\n```\n<sub>Type a code and press Enter. ICAO or IATA (KOA, LAX, NRT, SYD...); other 3-letter codes get a K. Resets to PHMU on restart. Sources: aviationweather.gov, atis.info. Read only.</sub>",
                  "entity_id": [
                    "sensor.wx_station_icao",
                    "sensor.wx_metar_station",
                    "sensor.wx_taf_station",
                    "sensor.wx_atis_station"
                  ],
                  "grid_options": {
                    "columns": "full"
                  },
                  "type": "markdown"
                },
                {
                  "content": "<details><summary><ha-icon icon=\"mdi:map-marker-radius\"></ha-icon> <b>Nearby: PHKO Kona and PHNL Honolulu</b></summary>{{ '\\n\\n' }}{%- macro age(e) -%}{%- set t = states(e) -%}{%- if t not in ['none', 'unknown', 'unavailable', ''] -%}{%- set d = as_datetime(t) -%}{{ ((now() - d).total_seconds() / 60) | int }} min ago{%- else -%}no report{%- endif -%}{%- endmacro -%}\n### METAR\n{% for st in ['PHKO', 'PHNL'] %}{% set e = 'sensor.wx_metar_' ~ st | lower %}\n**{{ st }}** <sub>{{ age(e) }}</sub>\n```\n{{ state_attr(e, 'rawOb') or 'No METAR on the network right now' }}\n```\n{% endfor %}\n### TAF\n{% for st in ['PHKO', 'PHNL'] %}{% set e = 'sensor.wx_taf_' ~ st | lower %}{% if state_attr(e, 'rawTAF') %}\n**{{ st }}** <sub>issued {{ age(e) }}</sub>\n```\n{{ state_attr(e, 'rawTAF') | regex_replace(' (FM|TEMPO|BECMG|PROB)', '\\n  \\\\1') }}\n```\n{% endif %}{% endfor %}\n### ATIS\n**PHNL D-ATIS {{ states('sensor.wx_phnl_atis') }}**\n```\n{{ state_attr('sensor.wx_phnl_atis', 'datis') or 'unavailable' }}\n```\n<sub>Sources: aviationweather.gov (METAR / TAF, 10 to 15 min), atis.info (PHNL D-ATIS, 5 min). Read only.</sub>{{ '\\n\\n' }}</details>",
                  "entity_id": [
